*>================================================================
*> PROGRAM:  lob_vwap_engine.cbl
*> PURPOSE:  Real-Time Volume-Weighted Average Price (VWAP) Engine
*> ================================================================
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LOB-VWAP-ENGINE.

 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
 SPECIAL-NAMES.
     DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  WS-FILL-NOTIONAL       PIC S9(15)V9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.

 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY "VWAP-STATE.cpy".
 01  LS-EXEC-PRICE          PIC S9(09)V9(04) COMP-3.
 01  LS-EXEC-QTY            PIC 9(08) COMP-5.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING VWAP-CALCULATOR-STATE, LS-EXEC-PRICE, LS-EXEC-QTY.
 0000-MAIN.
     IF LS-EXEC-QTY > 0 AND LS-EXEC-PRICE > 0
         COMPUTE WS-FILL-NOTIONAL = LS-EXEC-PRICE * LS-EXEC-QTY
         ADD WS-FILL-NOTIONAL TO VW-TOTAL-NOTIONAL
         ADD LS-EXEC-QTY TO VW-TOTAL-VOLUME
         ADD 1 TO VW-SAMPLE-COUNT
         MOVE LS-EXEC-PRICE TO VW-LAST-FILL-PRICE
         MOVE LS-EXEC-QTY TO VW-LAST-FILL-QTY
         IF VW-TOTAL-VOLUME > 0
             COMPUTE VW-CURRENT-VWAP = VW-TOTAL-NOTIONAL / VW-TOTAL-VOLUME
         END-IF
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
